      {
        "title": "Direct import of Button in AddToCartButton",
        "context": [
          "The add-to-cart button of the catalogue now takes the shared button from the file that declares it. It took the shared button from the index file of the shared components before. A shopper sees the same button, and a click still adds the product to the cart. One import line changes, and nothing that runs.",
          "",
          "## Overview",
          "",
          "- **When** a shopper clicks \"Add to cart\" on a product of the catalogue, **then** nothing changes.",
          "- **When** the cart page, the account page or the layout renders the shared button, **then** nothing changes.",
          "- **When** a tool reads the imports of the add-to-cart button, **then** [it finds the file of the shared button](code:src/routes/catalog/components/AddToCartButton.tsx#L1), and no longer the index file that also re-exports the dialog and the input.",
          "",
          "## Implementation",
          "",
          "**`src/routes/catalog/components/AddToCartButton.tsx`**",
          "",
          "- Modified [the import of `Button`](code:src/routes/catalog/components/AddToCartButton.tsx#L1) to read `@/components/ui/button`, the file that declares `Button`. It read the barrel `@/components/ui` before."
        ],
